OL,3,GNEWSALorry driver charged over fatal
OL,4,Acrash in 2024
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lorry driver has been charged with
OL,7,Fcausing death by dangerous driving
OL,8,Fafter a man was killed in a crash
OL,9,Falmost two years ago.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said Edward
OL,12,FHumphreys was driving a grey BMW car
OL,13,Fwhen it was involved in a collision
OL,14,Fwith a Volvo lorry on the A447 Hinckley
OL,15,FRoad in Cadeby on 21 November 2024.
OL,17,FThe 53-year-old died at the scene,
OL,18,Fofficers said.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
